  "source_review": [
    "All input parsing and hex conversion, airport preparation, and output capacity precede timing. Decode errors abort the run.",
    "Headline retains every complete message through the ending monotonic timer, consumes and releases results afterward, then responds.",
    "CPR mode decodes once, immediately routes DF17/18 through shared advance/live streamStep using current timestamp/address, and retains complete message plus position.",
    "Each CPR run starts empty with reference none and false update callback. No optional sanitization/enrichment or decoded-result cache.",
    "Pinned 6903 airports retain source order and exact finite binary64 coordinates; prepared timestamps and bytes match all corpus rows.",
    "Persistent workers perform one fresh requested run, flush readiness/results, reject unknown commands and rejected corpus frames; no private warmups.",
    "Frozen interleave.py runs 3 warmup AB pairs then 21 measured AB pairs, same inherited CPU affinity, retains all samples, requires WSL power-plan capture before/after, rejects changed plans.",
    "Candidate target is a default target at -O3/-ffp-contract=off; all 21 linked project object traces use these flags and no CPU-specific flags; no Spec/Proofs/Mathlib object is linked.",
    "Candidate guard exception is limited to Bench/WholeDecoder.lean and preserves forbidden Proofs dependency; it does not loosen Spec/Model/Capstones permissions."
  ],
